{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a3094bca76beda92668acd1acd71c1a2d457f595735e8bdecd816cf90c7155a5", "ja": "（風花の新衣装は、大人っぽい、綺麗な一着になった。\nきっと風花も喜んでくれるだろう！）", "zh": "（风花的新衣装做成了一套成熟又漂亮的服装。\n她一定也会很高兴吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7eddd6c3582b6a4906c1b1c86107ca6abc544f6086f069956e5f064a9ca1467f", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n素敵な衣装を用意してくれて、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n谢谢您为我准备了这么棒的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ef616024781fb94f0965ab7d8fc7d87c85f5429917cac2e36d92e31bf9b02750", "ja": "ど、どうしたんだ？　そんなに改まって……。\n衣装、あまり気に入らなかったか？", "zh": "怎、怎么了？突然这么郑重……\n是不太喜欢这套服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9a0c49695fb1c901ff7f07fbd58051be0331b646305af236b8b2a9e963e5ddf9", "ja": "いえ、そんなことは！\nとっても綺麗で、すごく素敵だと思いますよ。", "zh": "没有的事！\n我觉得非常漂亮，真的很棒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7304e24dbeda830882fbb06869cc2d34b463fdf326ff11db7ee8c6ef41428c77", "ja": "よかった……。でも何かあったのか？\nこういう系統の衣装は、好みだと思ったんだけど。", "zh": "那就好……不过，是发生什么事了吗？\n我以为你会喜欢这种风格的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a83bd01292d0e1f2bd3892546bf2fe1353976a854b7a8b3839876995b616c170", "ja": "はい、それはもう！　ただ……こういった衣装を\nいただく度に、私、大喜びしてますよね？", "zh": "是的，当然喜欢！只是……每次收到这种风格的服装，我都会特别开心，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "436df45cdb5435cf005e3cee92bfa3fce29a88344d6e4d17cbddf0e0c0b8f8c5", "ja": "せっかくの衣装を、私の好みで一喜一憂するのは、\nなんだかよくない気がして……。", "zh": "因为个人喜好，对这套来之不易的服装一会儿高兴一会儿失落，总觉得不太好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8af34323d0a98d0ef3556adac986e587130c5ca05a1439e0e3751d366f91bafb", "ja": "あっ。喜んでないからといって、\n嫌いというわけじゃないんですよ？　本当に！", "zh": "啊。虽说没有表现得很开心，\n但也并不是不喜欢哦？真的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e3f18fc9290b98fa66ce1fb41e2a4d06f4fdd62af44c90159ab858dd1aab9899", "ja": "ははっ、力説しなくても大丈夫だよ。風花が、\nどの衣装も大切にしてることはみんな知ってるからな。", "zh": "哈哈，不用这么极力解释也没关系。大家都知道，风花很珍惜每一套服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8caf030823ee887b5887ee8adfb475b86ee22507dc9e665685043af734898316", "ja": "だからこれからも気にせず、お気に入りの衣装があれば\n思いっきり喜んでくれ。そのほうがこっちも嬉しいよ。", "zh": "所以今后也不用顾虑，要是有喜欢的服装，就尽情开心吧。那样我这边也会很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "52815d698d7066471c34747b0d8095384b18f0f48ca31e0a5c29997431bf3370", "ja": "わかりました！\nそれじゃあ、今の流れ、やり直しますね♪", "zh": "明白了！\n那么，我们把刚才的流程重新来一遍吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
