{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d567c2c4d5da308b6398b6273cb8daa9513716f64ce3da8942177a4654f46b7a", "ja": "コホン……{$P$}さん、この衣装、\nとっても気に入りました。ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "咳咳……{$P$}先生，这套服装我非常喜欢。谢谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4344ccb73a633d3c9e8b4c20ba3420613502e2da04cb975a050fbefda5a77672", "ja": "……それはよかった！　曲のイメージとか、\n風花の雰囲気に合わせてデザインしてもらったんだ。", "zh": "……那就太好了！我让人配合歌曲的意象，\n还有风花的气质进行了设计。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "23aaef0d2898297b991e93f41bee55c9a16341042eac2313c34e5a16aed17f5b", "ja": "えっ……そうなんですか？\n私の、雰囲気……。", "zh": "诶……是这样吗？\n我的气质……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "14fc7ab7a6c25fa83c759803ad7251db705e1a18148a0324353c9295940828d8", "ja": "ふふ、ありがとうございます。やっぱり嬉しいですね。\n自分の好みと、強みが重なるのって。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢您。果然还是很开心呢。\n自己的喜好和长处能够重合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ee33ac3288ebcfe67ec4d3d64e364a7814c6fe6049e26c25f81337d12cd4cc89", "ja": "もっともっと、自分の理想に近づくために\n頑張ろうって、やる気が湧いてきます！", "zh": "为了更加接近自己的理想，\n我干劲十足，想要继续努力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b019e59c6fabbc787b7cd42571a69cf3cb7a0e71c55ba201f908b1202f4f0899", "ja": "ああ！　風花の理想に近づけるよう、俺も手伝うよ。\n一緒に頑張ろうな！", "zh": "啊！为了帮助你更接近风花的理想，我也会努力的。\n我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ec2d88caea1c7049075e08972f65f2276035cc2136adfba446b3858dda9dddf2", "ja": "はい♪　ひとつひとつのお仕事を、\n私なりに全力で取り組んでいこうと思います。", "zh": "好的♪我会用自己的方式，全力以赴地完成每一项工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4d7dfe63f441f7cc23c2159ad15f82ed6477d87b1203802f6dc311cc76ae57a5", "ja": "そうすれば、また素敵な衣装に出会えるかも\nしれませんし。ふふ、楽しみです！", "zh": "这样的话，说不定还能再次遇到漂亮的服装呢。\n呵呵，我很期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0434_1021_p", "source_sha256": "0a8d553af1c773c407eced167ff365bf7694f0603460a70e77517ec9de0db9fb", "ja": "（風花のいろんな一面を引き出して、いろんな衣装を\n着させてあげたいな。彼女の、喜ぶ顔が見たいから）", "zh": "（我想引出风花不为人知的各种一面，让她穿上各种各样的服装。因为我想看到她开心的表情）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
